    "html": "<p>When a transparent plastic is placed in vacuum, its refractive index is measured to be <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n_{P}\"></span>. The vacuum is then replaced first by gas A with refractive index of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n_{A}\"></span>, then by gas B with refractive index of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n_{B}\"></span>. In gas A <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{n_{A}}{n_{P}}=\\frac{1}{3}\"></span> and in gas B <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{n_{B}}{n_{P}}=\\frac{4}{9}\"></span>. The wavelength of light in gas A is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{A}\"></span> and the wavelength of light in gas B is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{B}\"></span>. What is the ratio <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda_{A}}{\\lambda_{B}}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{4}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4}{27}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{27}{4}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
